---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy policy" description="How Nepali Property Market collects, uses and protects personal information.">
	<div class="wrap narrow">
		<div class="page-head"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p class="muted">Draft: have this reviewed by a lawyer before launch.</p></div>
		<div class="prose">
			<h2>What we collect</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><b>Enquiries:</b> your name, mobile, email, message and the area you were browsing, when you send an enquiry to a business.</li>
				<li><b>Business listings:</b> business name, contact details, licence number, areas served and, where provided, claim requests.</li>
				<li><b>Usage:</b> counts of profile views and clicks on call, WhatsApp and website buttons. These are not linked to your identity.</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>How we use it</h2>
			<p>We pass your enquiry to the business you chose so they can contact you, keep a copy to resolve disputes and measure results, and send operational emails to businesses. We do not sell your information and do not send marketing without consent.</p>
			<h2>Public business information</h2>
			<p>Some business profiles are created from publicly available information such as licensing registers. Business owners can ask us to correct or remove a profile at any time.</p>
			<h2>Storage and security</h2>
			<p>Data is stored with our infrastructure providers. Access is restricted and enquiry data is kept only as long as needed for the purposes above.</p>
			<h2>Your rights</h2>
			<p>You can ask to access, correct or delete your personal information by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@nepalipropertymarket.com.au">hello@nepalipropertymarket.com.au</a>.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
